["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/trackStar", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "(\"Track\\*\" in the SSVC spec) The vulnerability contains specific characteristics that may require closer monitoring for changes. CISA recommends remediating Track\\* vulnerabilities within standard update timelines.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
